<p id="A1.SS1.SSS1.p2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.SSS1.p2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_align_center ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span class="ltx_rule ltx_filled_leader" style="width:345.0pt;height:1px;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <span id="A1.SS1.SSS1.p2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">The End of Trace</span> <span class="ltx_rule ltx_filled_leader" style="width:345.0pt;height:1px;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span></span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.SSS1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS1.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Here is another example response (partial) of <span id="A1.SS1.SSS1.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Qwen3-4B-Instruct</span> <span id="A1.SS1.SSS1.p3.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">after RL training</span> with grokking (as in Figure <a href="#S3.F6" title="Figure 6 ‣ 3.3 Attempts to Accelerate RL Grokking ‣ 3 Learnability Study: Can RL Uncover New Strategies and How to Accelerate it? ‣ DELTA-Code: How Does RL Unlock and Transfer New Programming Algorithms in LLMs?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> (c)) on a test problem in <span id="A1.SS1.SSS1.p3.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">MANUFACTORIA-HAS</span>: “Accept if the tape contains the substring <span id="A1.SS1.SSS1.p3.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">BRRR</span> (must be consecutive)”.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.SSS1.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS1.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.SSS1.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_align_center ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span class="ltx_rule ltx_filled_leader" style="width:345.0pt;height:1px;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <span id="A1.SS1.SSS1.p4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#006400;">Success Trace</span> <span class="ltx_rule ltx_filled_leader" style="width:345.0pt;height:1px;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span></span></p>
<div id="A1.SS1.SSS1.p4.2" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_language_markdown ltx_lstlisting ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx300" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx300.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">We</span><span id="lstnumberx300.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx300.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">are</span><span id="lstnumberx300.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx300.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">tasked</span><span id="lstnumberx300.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx300.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">with</span><span id="lstnumberx300.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx300.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">designing</span><span id="lstnumberx300.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx300.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">a</span><span id="lstnumberx300.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx300.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">factory</span><span id="lstnumberx300.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx300.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">in</span><span id="lstnumberx300.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx300.17" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">the</span><span id="lstnumberx300.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>**<span id="lstnumberx300.19" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">Manufactoria</span><span id="lstnumberx300.20" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx300.21" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">DSL</span>**<span id="lstnumberx300.22" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx300.23" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">that</span>:
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx301" class="ltx_listingline">
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx302" class="ltx_listingline">-<span id="lstnumberx302.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>**<span id="lstnumberx302.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">Accepts</span>**<span id="lstnumberx302.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx302.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">robots</span><span id="lstnumberx302.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx302.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">whose</span><span id="lstnumberx302.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx302.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">tape</span><span id="lstnumberx302.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx302.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">contains</span><span id="lstnumberx302.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx302.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">the</span><span id="lstnumberx302.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx302.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">substring</span><span id="lstnumberx302.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>**‘<span id="lstnumberx302.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">BRRR</span>‘**<span id="lstnumberx302.17" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>(<span id="lstnumberx302.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">four</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx303" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx303.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">consecutive</span><span id="lstnumberx303.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx303.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">characters</span>:<span id="lstnumberx303.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx303.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">B</span>,<span id="lstnumberx303.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx303.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">R</span>,<span id="lstnumberx303.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx303.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">R</span>,<span id="lstnumberx303.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx303.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">R</span>)
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx304" class="ltx_listingline">-<span id="lstnumberx304.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>**<span id="lstnumberx304.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">Rejects</span>**<span id="lstnumberx304.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx304.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">all</span><span id="lstnumberx304.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx304.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">others</span>.
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx305" class="ltx_listingline">
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx306" class="ltx_listingline">—
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx307" class="ltx_listingline">
</div>
