</span></td>
<td id="A1.T2.6.1.7.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb" style="padding:0.7pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T2.6.1.7.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:65.6pt;">
<span id="A1.T2.6.1.7.4.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T2.6.1.7.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">n 4–5; f 2.5; out 3–6; r 20; v 600–800</span></span>
</span></td>
